-Persist the session and refresh it through Supabase Auth as needed.
+Persist the session and refresh it through Supabase Auth as needed. A failed refresh
+must not silently create a new anonymous identity. Unity, Godot and Unreal use their
+HTTP/JSON facilities; no official Supagame native SDK exists. See the
+[agent integration skill](Agent-Skill) for engine-specific guidance.
